{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The equation of a scaled transformation of the graph of $f(x)=|x|$ can have the form:\n\n$g(x)=\\green{a}|x|$\n\nIf $|\\green{a}|\u003e1$, the graph is stretched vertically, and if $|\\green{a}|\u003c1$, the graph is compressed vertically.\n\nWhen $\\green{a}\u003c0$, the graph is then reflected across the $x$-axis.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's compare corresponding points in $\\blueD{f}$ and $\\maroonD{g}$. For example, $\\blueD{f}(4)=4$ and $\\maroonD{g}(4)=2$.\n\n$\\dfrac{2}{4}=0.5$\n\nEach $y$-coordinate in $\\maroonD{g}$ is $0.5$ times the distance from the $x$-axis as the corresponding $y$-coordinate in $\\blueD{f}$.  \n\nSo, $\\greenD{a}=0.5$.\n\n[[☃ interaction 1]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"interaction 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"elements":[{"key":"function-ab44e3","options":{"color":"#6495ED","funcName":"f","rangeMax":"10","rangeMin":"-10","strokeDasharray":"","strokeWidth":3,"value":"abs\\left(x\\right)"},"type":"function"},{"key":"function-b966e4","options":{"color":"#FF00AF","funcName":"g","rangeMax":"10","rangeMin":"-10","strokeDasharray":"- ","strokeWidth":3,"value":"0.5\\cdot abs\\left(x\\right)"},"type":"function"},{"key":"movable-point-66232f","options":{"constraint":"none","constraintFn":"0","constraintXMax":"5","constraintXMin":"-5","constraintYMax":"0","constraintYMin":"0","snap":0.5,"startX":"4","startY":"0","varSubscript":0},"type":"movable-point"},{"key":"line-913209","options":{"arrows":"","color":"#28AE7B","endX":"x_0","endY":"f\\left(x_0\\right)","startX":"x_0","startY":"0","strokeDasharray":"- ","strokeWidth":3},"type":"line"},{"key":"line-b63598","options":{"arrows":"","color":"#28AE7B","endX":"0","endY":"g\\left(x_0\\right)","startX":"x_0","startY":"g\\left(x_0\\right)","strokeDasharray":"","strokeWidth":3},"type":"line"},{"key":"line-fff428","